msgstr "避免从另一生命周期或状态维度虚构 intentionTransitionOf 目标。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/intentionTransitionOf|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference the actual gmeow:Intention supplied by the source and retain attributed alternatives."
msgstr "引用来源实际提供的 gmeow:Intention，并保留有归属的其他解释。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/intentionTransitionOf|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:record gmeow:intentionTransitionOf ex:target ."
msgstr "ex:record gmeow:intentionTransitionOf ex:target ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/intentionTransitionTenure|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "intention transition tenure"
msgstr "意图转换持有期"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/intentionTransitionTenure|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A known holding tenure relevant to this recorded intention transition, without automatically closing it."
msgstr "与此已记录意图转换相关的已知持有期，不自动关闭它。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/intentionTransitionTenure|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve the source’s intention transition tenure relation."
msgstr "用于保留来源的意图转换持有期关系。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/intentionTransitionTenure|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inventing a intentionTransitionTenure target from a different lifecycle or status axis."
msgstr "避免从另一生命周期或状态维度虚构 intentionTransitionTenure 目标。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/intentionTransitionTenure|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference the actual gmeow:IntentionTenure supplied by the source and retain attributed alternatives."
msgstr "引用来源实际提供的 gmeow:IntentionTenure，并保留有归属的其他解释。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/intentionTransitionTenure|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:record gmeow:intentionTransitionTenure ex:target ."
msgstr "ex:record gmeow:intentionTransitionTenure ex:target ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/attemptResumePoint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
